WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone is about to start!

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:07.540
Armed!

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:20.410
I can't use Avatar Armed!

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:21.910
Boohoo for you.

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:27.250
I knew it...

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:37.180
Why can't I use Avatar Armed?

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:18.430
A friendly match between Japan and America!

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:20.070
We're almost at the end of the first half!

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:22.720
Japan's representatives move into the opponent's field!

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:26.760
We're representing America and they're representing Japan...?

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:28.400
This mixes me up!

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:30.080
Press them in!

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.840
Oh, do you want the ball?

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:35.670
Then you can have it.

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:39.300
Kurama!

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:43.350
I'll stop them!

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:45.560
Dash Train!

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:47.850
You think you can stop me?

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:49.060
Now that's funny!

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.510
The ball goes back to Beta!

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:58.920
I'll stop them no matter what!

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:06.240
I won't let the soccer ban happen!

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:11.150
Here Matsukaze stands in front of Beta!

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:12.990
My, my...

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:15.040
I'll try it one more time!

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:24.430
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.160
Armed!

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:35.760
Once more!

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:37.480
Armed!

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:45.180
Once more!

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:49.120
Armed!

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:56.700
In that case...

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:01.080
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:06.010
I can get past your Avatar easily.

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:11.150
Tenma!

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:13.810
Unassisted Hand!

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:18.430
It's in!

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:20.400
Japan wins another point!

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:24.660
This is Protocol Omega 2.0...

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:31.450
The first half ends!

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:34.880
It ends with a big lead for Japan!

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:37.660
Will America pick up the fight in the second half?

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:48.430
Shinsuke, switch with Sangoku for goalkeeper.

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:49.800
Yes, sir!

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.030
Kurama and Kurumada are out.

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:54.070
Hayami, Kariya, Hikaru!

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:55.190
You're in for the second half.

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.130
Yes, sir!

00:04:58.020 --> 00:04:58.840
Tenma.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:02.360
Why couldn't I use Avatar Armed?

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.650
This is just my guess...

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:12.370
But I think it's because the mutual resonance of space-time that allowed you to use Avatar Armed before isn't happening now.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:19.940
Immediately after a timeline is meddled with, the amplitude of its time allowed multiple identities of you to coexist.

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:24.400
These multiple Tenmas resonated with each other, raising your power.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:35.770
But now that some time has passed and the amplitudes involving Raimon Junior High have settled back down,

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:39.480
the parallel worlds have disappeared and their mutual resonance isn't taking place.

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:45.440
I didn't really understand, but you mean I can't use Avatar Armed anymore?

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.510
Yeah...

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:55.140
You'll have to increase your power on your own and gain even greater power to achieve the real Avatar Armed.

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:57.720
Greater power?

00:05:57.720 --> 00:06:01.000
We can't keep relying on something that's useless to us.

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:02.930
Shindou-senpai.

00:06:02.930 --> 00:06:06.220
For now, we must fight using only our Avatars.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:07.880
That's right.

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:10.690
I'll do my best too!

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:11.580
Okay!

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.780
Now, it's the second half!

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:16.160
America's team has changed its lineup!

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.160
It's the kickoff!

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:19.640
Let's go!

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:20.430
Okay!

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.380
Begin.

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:27.360
Yes, master.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:29.360
Kageyama dribbles in with the ball!

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:30.820
Drim goes to mark him!

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:35.870
Kageyama is blown back by Drim's fierce charge!

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:40.970
A red card!

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:44.400
That was an incredibly dangerous play! That goes without saying!

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:48.800
Oh? Japan continues its play!

00:06:50.730 --> 00:06:52.800
Don't you see this red card?

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.060
Shut up!

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:02.480
Oh my goodness! Orca has blown back the referee trying to stop her!

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:06.420
What's happening?

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:14.490
More rough play that's enough to earn another red card!

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.950
But Japan's representatives won't stop!

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.540
What's this?

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:22.000
Japan's representatives are ignoring the ref's call and continuing to play!

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:25.350
This is bad! This is very bad!

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:30.010
If we don't stop them, soccer will be viewed as an uncivilized sport.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.150
Let's go, Tenma!

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.290
We've got to stop them!

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:33.260
Okay!

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:36.690
Get back!

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.800
Tenma! Tsurugi-kun!

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:40.910
This isn't soccer!

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:44.510
They never intended to play decent soccer in the first place!

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:50.320
They're doing this to make it known to the world that soccer is uncivilized and dangerous.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.760
What a horrible game...

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:59.230
But if I stop the game here, we won't take back the real history.

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:01.500
What should I do?

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:04.500
Coach, we're going!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.090
We can't let them do what they want.

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:09.480
No way am I staying put here and watching.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:10.690
You guys...

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:14.720
I'll just have to bet this on everyone's feelings.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.890
Okay, change members.

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:22.160
America changes its members! They are resolutely determined to continue the game!

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:24.920
I'm counting on you, guys.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:30.570
Tenma!

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:31.360
Okay!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.270
Aoyama!

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:39.780
Hold them down!

00:08:40.070 --> 00:08:41.200
Out of the way!

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:46.460
Three more are taken down by violent rough plays!

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:49.620
No way...

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:52.130
What do we do now?

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:56.050
It's okay, I'll bring out the Dupli.

00:08:57.740 --> 00:08:59.140
Let's go, guys!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:00.550
Okay!

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:05.600
America quickly makes another member change and chases after the ball!

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:07.650
Now!

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.190
Fei steals the ball!

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:12.450
He heads for Japan's goal!

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:14.670
You can bring out Dupli?

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:19.910
You must be eating up a lot of energy in that state. 
 But for how long will you keep that up?

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:21.910
Got you surrounded.

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:24.370
We finally have the chance to talk.

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:29.750
You called yourself Fei-san, right?

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:34.010
Your existence isn't recorded in El Dorado's archives.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:39.370
But you have the same level of technology that we do for time jumping.

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:43.270
You're an irregular element who defies El Dorado.

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:45.850
Just who are you?

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:48.590
Answer me. Who are you?

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:51.200
Why do you interfere with us?

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:52.840
I'm... Fei.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:55.490
Fei Rune!

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:59.010
I just want to protect soccer from you guys!

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:01.940
Tch, he's still putting up a fight!

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:04.580
How cute.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:06.490
Fei!

00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:07.710
Give me the ball!

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:08.880
Okay!

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:11.510
That's right...

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:14.410
If we lose here, everything will disappear.

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:18.520
If we want to protect soccer, we have to win!

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:22.470
Reach the heavens!

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:25.930
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:34.080
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:39.220
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:42.840
Matsukaze gets ready to shoot with his Avatar!

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:53.640
Justice Wing!

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:05.120
The past that El Dorado chooses is the real past.

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:08.220
We won't allow you to rise against it.

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:12.870
Oh, dear me!

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:15.320
I'm sorry, I took the ball!

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:17.150
You're kidding me...

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:20.320
She stopped Demon God Pegasus Arc's hissatsu shoot...

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:23.200
Now then, I think...

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:27.070
It's time to show you what real despair is like!

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.180
Tenma!

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:34.860
Guys, tighten the defense!

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.620
Beta charges in!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:38.860
I won't let you!

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:46.190
Mantle!

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:50.520
Dupli aren't enough to stop me!

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.480
I'll stop you!

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:57.580
Atlantis Wall!

00:11:57.910 --> 00:11:59.770
Deep Mist!

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:02.180
Out of my way!

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.220
We'll stop you!

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:05.890
Let's go, guys!

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.950
Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:19.750
Sengoku War God Musashi!

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:22.520
Sword Saint Lancelot!

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:25.340
Planet Guardian God Titanius!

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.710
You still resist me?

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:34.060
You leave me no choice then.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:38.050
I'll crush you without leaving a scrap behind!

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:38.970
Come out!

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:42.730
Goddess of the Vacant Skies, Athena!

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:44.520
Armed!

00:12:57.310 --> 00:13:00.420
Shoot Command 07!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:01.750
<Double Shot>

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:22.760
Oh dear! Here the referees unanimously declare a suspension!

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:25.660
Can you believe it?! A soccer friendly has been suspended!

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:29.220
But is it right to call this soccer?!

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:30.700
It is much too ghastly!

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.700
America's team has wounds all over their bodies!

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:35.860
To think Japan's team would play a game like this!

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:39.240
As a fellow Japanese, I am terribly ashamed!

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:45.850
It will be a pain if you guys continue to keep getting in our way.

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:53.160
So I'm going to take away all of your enthusiasm for soccer.

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:55.880
So that you may never fight against El Dorado ever again.

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:59.740
Mind Control Mode.

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:09.780
What was that light?

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:11.670
Fei-san.

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:13.680
You are dangerous to have around.

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:19.250
So I'm going to imprison you, okay?

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:22.040
Lock-in Mode.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.770
What?

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:30.890
We'll examine every inch of you while you're imprisoned in the Compressed Dimension.

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:35.380
Fei!

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:48.010
God Hand V!

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:53.720
Everyone, hang back for now!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.420
Coach Endou!

00:14:55.860 --> 00:15:00.110
Unfortunately, in our current state, we're not strong enough to beat them!

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:00.830
Hurry!

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:02.030
O-Okay!

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:04.750
Everyone, over here!

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:06.700
Doctor Aruno!

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:08.110
Guys, hurry and get on!

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:13.760
Fei, you go too!

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.140
Okay!

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:19.600
What are you going to do? They're escaping.

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:25.960
Beta.

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:28.940
Change of target.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.740
Imprison Endou Mamoru.

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:33.890
Yes, master.

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:35.550
We're all aboard!

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:36.730
Coach, hurry!

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:37.890
Okay!

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:45.490
Coach!

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:52.680
Coach!

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.320
No, Tenma!

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:55.310
It's too late!

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:56.690
But Coach Endou...!

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:07.360
Aw, they got away.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:09.480
That's okay.

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:13.360
We've got Endou-san captured. {200 years in the future, the invention of the Master Ball is perfected}

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.360
Coach...

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:19.990
What happened to Coach Endou?!

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:20.580
Tenma...

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:23.710
He must be imprisoned.

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:25.120
Imprisoned?

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:32.840
He's stuck inside the Compressed Dimension, unable to move or speak or do anything at all.

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:35.430
No way...

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:51.260
We couldn't change history back to the way it was...

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:55.090
Coach Endou...

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:56.950
We've no time to waste being depressed!

00:16:57.150 --> 00:17:00.100
Now is the time to think about what to do from here!

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:03.120
A chance to strike back is sure to come!

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:06.700
What the bear says is right!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:07.710
Who are you calling a bear?!

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:11.090
Moping around just isn't my style!

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:13.660
More than anything, it goes against my Raimon spirit!

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:15.720
Nishiki-senpai...

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.400
Nice attitude there.

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:24.750
What's taken from us, we'll just take right back.

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.750
Yeah, you're right.

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:28.770
Let's take it back together!

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:33.120
Both Coach Endou and our soccer!

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:36.980
If you're going to do it, you're on your own.

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:39.700
I won't be helping anymore.

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:41.200
Hayami?

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:44.030
Why was I playing soccer?

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:46.210
Yeah, I just don't get it.

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:48.930
Let's just hurry back home and catch some TV.

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:51.880
What's wrong with you guys?

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:53.300
Nothing.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.990
We just came back to our senses.

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:58.920
I don't want to play soccer again, ever.

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:00.930
Just thinking about it ticks me off!

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:04.530
Why was I playing it?

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:07.550
Soccer is full of nothing but bad things.

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:12.470
I don't understand why I was so fired up about it.

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:27.970
I get it!

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:30.170
Those were mind control waves!

00:18:30.430 --> 00:18:33.110
Mind control?

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:38.740
That light they shone on us can change the way humans think!

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:46.930
<i>I'm going to take away all of your enthusiasm for soccer.</i>

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:50.590
This is what she meant?

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:55.260
Then, has everyone lost their feelings for soccer?

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:58.070
Nothing as simple as that.

00:18:58.070 --> 00:19:01.600
They must have exchanged those feelings into hatred for soccer.

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:04.820
Hatred for soccer?

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:10.370
As if that could ever fully change our feelings for soccer!

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:17.230
But when a person is overwhelmed by the enemy's strength and has fallen into a pit of despair, they are emotionally weakened.

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:19.630
By pushing them in that state of mind...

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:23.170
But that light washed over us too.

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:25.140
Why are we okay?

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:30.280
Avatars are originally the physical manifestation of the strength of a person's heart.

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:34.150
They must have acted as a barrier and reflected the light.

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:38.170
So people without Avatars got a direct hit.

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:41.800
And it made them hate soccer...

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:43.910
How low can they go?

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:45.740
Why...

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:48.940
Why do they all have to hate soccer?

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:51.660
Soccer hasn't done anything wrong!

00:19:51.970 --> 00:19:53.170
Tenma...

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:57.670
Hey doc, isn't there some way to turn them all back?

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:01.820
Mind control is a form of hypnosis.

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:06.410
If you defeat Protocol Omega, you may find a way to undo it.

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:09.050
Defeat them?

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:11.240
Those guys who beat us just now?!

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:13.550
But there is no other way.

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:22.170
Also, as time passes, those who have been affected by the mind control may accept their hatred for soccer as truth.

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:23.160
No way...

00:20:23.470 --> 00:20:26.200
Well, do your best.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:30.250
Tenma, what do we do?

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:33.330
We'll have to make a team that can beat them.

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:40.500
It's the only way if we want to get back our coach, our friends, and our soccer!

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:48.220
We have to get even stronger than we are now, get the power to use Avatar Armed, and beat Protocol Omega!

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:50.970
Avatar Armed...

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:53.840
It's true that with that power...

00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:55.700
Things just might work out.

00:20:56.170 --> 00:21:00.420
But how do you plan on getting the power for Avatar Armed?

00:21:00.420 --> 00:21:01.670
I don't know...

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:05.820
But despite being up against people from the future, and no matter how much history has changed,

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:08.170
there's only one real way to get stronger!

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:09.550
What's that?

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:12.500
Training!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:15.310
I just know that's what Coach Endou would say if he was here!

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:16.920
Tenma!

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:18.640
Tenma is right.

00:21:22.100 --> 00:21:23.890
Okay!

00:21:24.140 --> 00:21:26.150
Let's do it!

00:22:54.300 --> 00:22:56.290
Gouenji-san arrives!

00:22:56.290 --> 00:22:59.920
What's the secret to achieving Avatar Armed?

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:02.460
Next, Training at God Eden!

00:23:02.460 --> 00:23:04.820
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:19.560
The Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone's proverb today is...

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:26.070
There's only one real way to get stronger! 
Training!!

00:23:26.070 --> 00:23:27.520
That's all!
